      "content": "hey, i'm working on a period piece set in the bronx around 1975. we're trying to get the vibe right for some background characters and street-level inhabitants. can you give me some archetypes or descriptions of the typical people you'd see walking the streets back then to help with casting? we want it to feel really gritty and authentic.",
